# Vuex Store

See `docs/agents/architecture.md` for module overview.

- One module per domain in `src/store/modules/`
- Modules expose `reset` action — register in root `store/index.js` reset dispatch
- Use namespaced modules (`user/`, `tenants/`, `bookables/`, …)
- Keep API calls in services, not in store actions (actions call `Api*Service`)
- Current tenant: `store.getters["tenants/currentTenantId"]`
